{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "price",
  "description": "P6-04a round 2. Covers price.json (monthly top/peak/flat/valley tariff). 结构冻结、语义未确认 (structure frozen, semantics unconfirmed): no business reader exists in iems_v3; ems_ua.c only writes and reads the document back (src/ems/ems_ua.c:517-529, :987-993). Required keys are the documented row shape, not a reader requirement.",
